# DWES Project Profile

Maintained working model of the Digital Wiring Execution System. Update when stack,
ports, or major structure changes.

## CURSOR RULES (repo)

| Rule | Path | Apply |
|------|------|-------|
| Project skill | `dwes-project-skill.mdc` | always |
| Change management | `change-management.mdc` | always |
| UI smoke test | `ui-refactor-smoke-test.mdc` | always |
| This profile | `dwes-profile.mdc` | on demand |
| Technician wiring | `technician-wiring-workflow.mdc` | wiring files |
| Report branding | `report-branding.mdc` | report files |

## MCP SERVERS

Config: **`.cursor/mcp.json`** (reload Cursor after edits)

| Server | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `dwes-filesystem` | DWES repo read/search (scoped to project root) |
| `dwes-database` | PostgreSQL **WiringSchemeDB** — read-only inspection; match `backend/.env` `DATABASE_URL` |
| `git` | DWES repo history/diffs |
| `browser` | UI smoke at `http://localhost:5175` |
| `memory` | Cross-session profile/conventions |

**DB MCP:** read-only by default; `dwes-db-guard` applies — no DDL/writes without approval.

## STACK

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Frontend | React 19 + TypeScript, Vite 8, React Router |
| Backend | NestJS 10, Node.js |
| Primary DB | PostgreSQL **WiringSchemeDB** via Prisma 7 (`prisma db pull` only — no migrations) |
| Auth store | SQLite `backend/data/dwes_auth.sqlite` (WebAuthn credentials — app-managed) |
| Styling | Tailwind v4 + `design-system.css`, `tokens.css`, `themes.css`, `buttons.css` |
| Auth | JWT (localStorage `dwes_token`), Passport, optional WebAuthn |
| 3D (optional) | `@react-three/fiber`, `@react-three/drei` |
| Reports | PDFKit, pdf-lib, ExcelJS, xlsx |

**Dev commands:** `npm run dev:all` (FE :5175, BE :3001) · `npm run build` · `npm run backup`

## STRUCTURE

```
DWES/
├── src/                          # React frontend
│   ├── pages/{role}/             # Role dashboards (admin, director, supervisor, technician, qaqc)
│   ├── components/{ui,layout,technician,supervisor,...}
│   ├── services/api.ts           # Axios client → /api proxy
│   ├── store/                    # Zustand (auth, project selection, UI)
│   ├── styles/                   # Global CSS design system
│   └── hooks/
├── backend/src/                  # NestJS modules
│   ├── auth/ tech/ supervisor/ director/ admin/ projects/ upload/ frames/
│   ├── common/report-branding.ts
│   └── prisma/ → ../prisma/schema.prisma
├── backend/uploads/<PROJECT_CODE>/frames|drawings/   # Frame JSON + drawings (filesystem, not DB tables)
├── backend/prisma/schema.prisma  # WiringSchemeDB schema (read-only DDL)
├── scripts/                      # backup, dev ports, certs, demo
└── .cursor/rules/                # Project AI rules
```

## CONVENTIONS

| Area | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Naming | kebab-case files; PascalCase components; `pj-*` supervisor project UI; `dwf-*` wiring frame |
| API client | `src/services/api.ts` — named exports (`authApi`, `projectsApi`, `techApi`, …) |
| Layout | `AppShell` + `Sidebar` ("Workspace") + `DashboardShell` + `PageContainer` |
| Errors | Axios interceptors; NestJS exceptions; UI toasts/modals |
| Validation | `class-validator` backend; form state + `useAppDialog` frontend |
| Roles | `admin`, `director`, `supervisor`, `technician`, `qaqc` — route per role dashboard |

## CORE DOMAIN

| Entity | Notes |
|--------|-------|
| **projects** | Code format `VOLTAGE_REGION_LOCATION_YEAR_SEQ` (SEQ 3-digit); `project_state` enum |
| **tech_assignments** | Technician ↔ panel/frame; wiring progress on assignment |
| **panel_inspections** | QA/QC — use `overall_result`, `redmarkup_check`, `inspection_notes` |
| **session_log** | Audit log — **no `user_name`**; JOIN `users` for names |
| **Frames** | JSON files under `uploads/<code>/frames/` — not a DB table |
| **Drawings** | PDF/DWG under `uploads/<code>/drawings/` — not a DB table |
| **Cable progress** | `(cables_src_done + cables_dst_done) / (cables_total * 2) * 100` |

